{"script":"yd_025_05","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","noOut":false,"x":-500,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-125,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":165,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-272,"img":"chara025_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]虽然我对新事物总是充满兴趣，但有一样东西我还是很讨厌的，那就是……蜘蛛！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]尽管我也是森林人，天天都会在野外接触到许多虫虫……但每次看到蜘蛛，还是能把我吓一跳……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]有一次我都准备睡觉了，突然好像看见一只蜘蛛一样的虫，我提着灯在房间里找了一整晚，结果回过神来，发现天都亮了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]你也觉得蜘蛛很吓人吧？听说那个驿站旅店的地窖里全是那些玩意，光是想想都要头皮发麻，真不知道驿站的人是怎么忍下来的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara025_1_face_chara025_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"嘉莉缇","text":"[show]——噫！那护栏上的虫子是蜘蛛吗！？唉……？[r]噢，哈、哈哈，原来只是一只小瓢虫啊……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"}],"des":"嘉莉缇-熟识2"}